ce_quote":"劉惇字子仁，平原人也。遭亂避地，客游廬陵，事孫輔。以明天官達占數顯於南土。每有水旱寇賊，皆先時處期，無不中者。輔異焉，以爲軍師，軍中咸敬事之，號曰神明。","person_id":"7ko_vou_bwp","related_person_ids":["e8h_aeo_zy8"],"reading":"平原人避地廬陵，所事是孫權從兄孫輔；神明為兵中人所號。","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-063-liudun","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-063-liudun"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-063-liudun:line032:reading-000-065","kind":"received_sentence","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-063-liudun:line032","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":65,"source_quote":"建安中，孫權在豫章，時有星變，以問惇，惇曰：「災在丹楊。」權曰：「何如？」曰：「客勝主人，到某日當得問。」是時邊鴻作亂，卒如惇言。","person_id":"7ko_vou_bwp","related_person_ids":["572_278_cba","rit_tr5_qrv"],"reading":"建安中丹楊亂，記邊鴻；參卷51孫翊傳原號。","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-063-liudun","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-063-liudun"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-063-liudun:line034:reading-000-059","kind":"received_sentence","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-063-liudun:line034","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":59,"source_quote":"惇於諸術皆善，尤明太乙，皆能推演其事，窮盡要妙，著書百餘篇，名儒刁玄稱以爲奇。惇亦寶愛其術，不以告人，故世莫得而明也。","person_id":"7ko_vou_bwp","related_person_ids":["s7m_pgz_fux"],"reading":"明太乙且著書百餘篇；刁玄稱奇。","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-063-liudun","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-063-liudun"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-063-liudun:line030:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"劉惇","kind":"person","person_id":"7ko_vou_bwp","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-063-liudun:line030","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-063-liudun"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-063-liudun:line030:m0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"子仁","kind":"person","person_id":"7ko_vou_bwp","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-063-liudun:line030","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-063-liudun"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-063-liudun:line032:m0017","start":17,"en